{"unit_id": "tag:01MJ:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring）。设<MATH_0002>为分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。\n我们在引理<REF_0001>中已经看到如何构造拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0004>（这是<MATH_0005>上的一个模（modules）层），以及如何构造映射（map）\n<MATH_0006>\n它将次数（degree）为<MATH_0007>的<MATH_0008>分量映到<MATH_0009>的整体截面（global sections）。\n次数（degree）为<MATH_0010>的分量，取自第<MATH_0011>次扭转（twist）<MATH_0012>（这是分次（graded）模（module）<MATH_0013>的扭转，见《代数（Algebra）》第<REF_0002>节），等于<MATH_0014>。因此我们可以得到映射（maps）\n<MATH_0015>\n我们希望能对任意拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0016>（位于<MATH_0017>上）施行这一操作。我们将通过与第<MATH_0018>次扭转（twist）后的结构层（structure sheaf）作张量积（tensoring）来实现这一点，见定义<REF_0003>。为了联系这两个概念，我们将用到下面的引理。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "twist", "target_term": "扭转"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "twist", "target_term": "扭转"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层"}, {"source_term": "tensoring", "target_term": "张量积"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "本段设定的环"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰初始给定的模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "初始给定的分次模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "先前引理构造的层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "说明所构造的层是模层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "从给定次数的分量到整体截面的映射"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "原模分量的分次指标"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面", "context": "目标层在整个空间上的截面"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "扭转后的模分量的分次指标"}, {"source_term": "twist", "target_term": "扭转", "context": "分次模的指定次数扭转"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰扭转所作用的模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "作为扭转对象的分次模"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "说明分次模扭转的引用章节"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "依扭转后分量的等式得到的映射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "希望将此操作推广至的任意层"}, {"source_term": "twist", "target_term": "扭转", "context": "结构层的指定次数扭转"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层", "context": "用于给出扭转的结构层"}, {"source_term": "tensoring", "target_term": "张量积", "context": "与扭转后的结构层作张量积的操作"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01MK:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring）。\n设<MATH_0002>为引理<REF_0001>中的概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0003>是齐次（homogeneous）的。设<MATH_0004>为一点（point），它对应于齐次素理想（homogeneous prime）<MATH_0005>。\n设<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>为分次（graded）<MATH_0008>-模（modules）。\n存在如下典范映射（canonical map）（在<MATH_0009>-模（modules）的意义下）\n<MATH_0010>\n它诱导如下典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0011>\n作用在<MATH_0012>上的截面（sections）上，同时也诱导如下典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0013>\n作用在<MATH_0014>处的茎（stalks）上。此外，下列图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0015>\n是交换（commutative）的，其中竖直的映射（maps）由（<REF_0002>）给出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous prime", "target_term": "齐次素理想"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "引理给定的环"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引用前一引理中的对象"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次", "context": "给定元素的性质"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "概形上与齐次素理想对应的点"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous prime", "target_term": "齐次素理想", "context": "与概形中的点对应的素理想"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰两个给定的模"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "引理给定的两个分次模"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "引理断言其存在的模之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "说明引理构造的映射是模之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "在截面上诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "在所指定对象上的截面"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "在茎上诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "在所指定点处的茎"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "引理末尾列出的图表"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换", "context": "断言图表具有交换性"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "图表中的竖直映射"}], "notes": []}
